    "detailed_description": "PowerUp Elevation is an cool little simple 'autorun' platform game set in a world full of crushing elevators and deadly traps. Avoid spikes, use gravity flip, pick up powerups and time your jumps well in increasingly challenging stages in order to steal a kiss from your mate before the &quot;death&quot; time runs out.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/879390/extras/1344d015876e1661016bfb1d40029e97.webp?t=1667140772\" /></div><br><strong>Features :</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Slower or faster gameplay mode.<br></li><li> Two difficult settings/ two endings.<br></li><li> 6 worlds, each world contains 8 levels + 1 practice level.<br></li><li> You will be killed a LOT, so unlimited lives are enabled (but show time used).<br></li><li> The game can been played a bit slower than normal for casual players with no penaty.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/879390/extras/77a71b0fd41ebe587439b3fa46df1f33.avif?t=1667140772\" /></div>",
